window.products.push({"id":1120093,"name":"The Perfect Peanuts Illuminated Christmas Tabletop Tree","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Lv69EERoL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"If there's one thing that Charlie Brown and the PEANUTS® gang know how to do, it's to bring holiday fun to your Christmas season! Now you can add some sparkle to your holiday season with The Perfect PEANUTS Christmas Tree, available exclusively from The Bradford Exchange. Measuring over a foot tall, this officially licensed PEANUTS holiday decor really is the perfect tree because it arrives fully assembled, pre-decorated with round and snowflake-shaped ornaments and pre-lit with an array of built-in LED lights!Expertly handcrafted, this glitter-touched tree overflows with intricately designed figurines of your cherished PEANUTS® friends, each one capturing their unique personalities, holiday attire and charming dispositions. You'll see Linus hilariously using his beloved blanket as his shepherd's costume for the Christmas pageant as Snoopy and Woodstock decorate a miniature tree. As always, shy Schroeder is poised over his piano while Peppermint Patty, Pigpen and Marcie spread a little Christmas music of their own. The ever-hopeful Sally stands at the mailbox in her dress and long-sleeve sweater to send Santa her elaborate Christmas wish list. And it wouldn't be Christmas without Charlie Brown stopping by Lucy's makeshift psychiatrist's booth for a seemingly endless amount of holiday advice. Strong demand is expected for this illuminated tabletop tree, so don't delay. Order now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Lv69EERoL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Bradford Exchange","source_asin":"B07YBHJFNN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1120093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YBHJFNN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YBHJFNN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
