window.products.push({"id":1120102,"name":"8x10 Shadow Box | Top Loading Shadow Box | ShadowBox Display Case | Wood Shadow Box | Deep Shadow Box | Ticket Shadow Box | Ticket Stubs Holder | Memo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PLgWd7L7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"People accumulate a lot of memories during their lifetime and have mementos from those various events and moments. This top loading shadow box provides a good way to showcase and store sports medals, awards, keepsakes, travel ticket stubs, wedding cards, sea shells, and other memorabilia. Shadow box frame Features: -Exterior dimension is 9.2 by 11.2inch. Interior dimension is 8 by 10 inch. Accommodates objects up to 2.1 inch thick. -PVC display backboard, with top loading. -Real glass front cover. PS: A piece acrylic cover is included as a gift. -Hanging hardware is pre-installed. Exclusive package is designed to make sure the safe delivery. Display a cherished memory with our wood shadowbox. It's designed to keep objects or photographs. Create your own collections with items you treasured. Polished glass to protect whatever you put in it. The simple and classic style design matches varieties of decors and color schemes. Suitable for almost any home or office space. The flexi-tabs and pre attached hardware makes this wooden box frame comes ready to hang or stand for your preferance. It can stand on a table or be wall mounted with included hangers. The back board can be easily opened to change items. Top loading slot make the box easier to drop your tickets, money or coins. A shadow box is an ideal gift for special days. Fill it with pictures, postcards, tickets or other memorabilia to create your own timeless collage. From kids to adults all will like to cherish their achievements with a display case and it's also a great place to store what they treasure.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PLgWd7L7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRAME YI","source_asin":"B07YCJ36Y1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1120102","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YCJ36Y1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YCJ36Y1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
