window.products.push({"id":1120172,"name":"Angelhood Blanket Hoodie Wearable Blanket,Super Soft Warm Oversized Blanket Sweatshirt Flannel Sherpa Blanket with Giant Pocket for Men Women Teens Fr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iDD-fsYmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REVERSIBLE HOODED BLANKET - With this blanket sweatshirt, you can say goodbye to the cold. Our sweatshirt blanket is made with super soft microfiber fleece on the front and Sherpa lining on the other. you can choose the side you like.High quality materials provide the ultimate comfort, softness & happiness.warmth everywhere you go. ONE SIZE FITS ALL - The large, oversized comfortable design is perfect fit for all shapes & sizes. Enough for all adults, ladies, men and children. And the design is like a robe, as if you are wearing your favorite sweatshirt! It is perfect for lounging at home, watching TV, gaming, reading a book, napping, or any camping or outdoor activities. INTIMATE DETAIL DESIGN - The oversized wearable blanket is equipped with two giant pockets that can store your mobile devices, such as phone, tablet, and remote controls, also snacks. The sweater blanket also has large sleeves, oversized hood, elastic cuffs and wide neck design which allow you to move your limbs and body easily. IDEAL GIFT CHOICE - Makes a great gift for moms, dads, wifes, husbands, kids, families, friends, students on Mother's Day, Father's day, Christmas, Easter, Valentine's Day, Thanksgiving, New Year's Eve, birthdays, bridal showers, weddings, anniversaries, back to school, graduation,etc. BREEZY MAINTENANCE AND WORRY-FREE WARRANTY - Just throw Angelhood wearable blanket in the wash machine and tumble dry in low heat. Do not bleach or iron. It will stay as good as new without any shedding, fading or deformation. Here at Angelhood, we offer 30 days free exchange and life-time warranty. Feel free to contact us at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iDD-fsYmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Angelhood","source_asin":"B096MC9G2G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1120172","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096MC9G2G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096MC9G2G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1120173,"name":"Delta Blinds Supply Custom-Made, Faux Wood Horizontal Window Blinds, 2 Inch Slats, Mahogany, Inside Mount","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+6ac4MC+L._AC_SL1088_.jpg","description":"These window blinds are custom made to order and are not pre-made, stocked blinds. Our inside mount 2\" Faux Wood Mahogany (cherry burgundy) window blinds have the rich, natural look of real wood, but offer advantages that wood cannot. Our Faux wood slats are made of a polyvinyl blend that is warp resistant and are best suited for humid conditions, making these blinds ideal for kitchens and bathrooms. Our Faux Wood material is also Greengaurd Certified for both Air Control Quality and Children and Schools. MEASURING INTRUCTIONS: Please do not use the measurements of a blind that needs replacing. Instead, please read our measuring instructions located in our photos. Our blinds are recommended for window casings that are at least 3\" deep because if less than that, the blinds will protrude and you will be able to see the metal installation brackets from a side angle (VALANCES DO NOT COME WITH CORNER PIECES.)DISCLAIMER ONLY FOR FAUX WOOD MAHOGANY: Should not be installed in an area where this material is exposed to degrees hotter than 120 F in temperature because warping may occur.All computer monitors are different from one another, therefore, the colors that you see online may not be 100% accurate to what you see in person. We STRONGLY RECOMMEND requesting FREE COLOR SAMPLES from us so that you are completely satisfied, please call (678)745-4113 to request free samples or Contact Us on Amazon. DELTA BLINDS SUPPLY'S RETURN POLICY: Buyers pay for return shipping, a 30% restocking fee on all blind returns as they are all custom cut to size to order. Before placing your order, please verify and confirm the sizes and colors you are ordering are accurate so that you are completely satisfied. Thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+6ac4MC+L._AC_SL1088_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Delta Blinds Supply","source_asin":"B01CR9JTDA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1120173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CR9JTDA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CR9JTDA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
