window.products.push({"id":1120208,"name":"Toaster 2 Slice Extra Wide Slot Toasters Best Rated Prime Stainless Steel with Bagel/Reheat/Cancel Function Black Toaster for Bread with Removable Cru","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818guehodDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"b>Start your day with a perfectly crisp slice of toast made by this 2-Slice Toaster. ① This best 2 slice toaster offers a timeless look that coordinates with nearly any kitchen and gives you excellent using experience with the precise control and high-end touch; ② With its two extra wide slots, this kitchen toasters 2 slice can easily accommodate bagels, waffles, pastries, hand-sliced bread and more; ② Featuring a user friendly control panel and an intuitive dial, precise controls with browning shape ranges from 1 (light) to 6 (dark) and three options for Bagel, Reheat, and Cancel...Whether you are preparing a sandwich or bagel, this reliable toasting gives you a crispy evenly result every time;  ③ A high rise lever elevates toast automatically for easy retrieval. This silver 2 slice toaster also makes cleanup easy thanks to its removable crumb tray. Start Your Day With Toast Made Your Way ! How to Use this Bread Toaster 2 Slice？ Step 1：Place the bread in the toaster. Step 2: Set the browning control to your desired setting. Step 3：Press the lift lever down. Step 4：The lift lever will pop up automatically when toasting is finished. 2 Slice Toaster Specification: Material: 100% high grade stainless steel Color: silver Item size: L9.6'' X W6.3''X H7.5'' Function： 3 Classic Mode & 6 Bread Shade Control Package Includes: 1 x 2-Slice Toaster 1 x User Manual Safety & Certification： 100% Safety Protection: Fire retardant material, Anti-scalded Design, certified with safety, non-toxic and BPA free for complete peace of mind. We offer a 12-month after-sale service for this stainless Toaster 2 slice. If you have any issues of your order, please let us know, we will give you the best solution in 24 hours to meet your 100% satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818guehodDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"pipigo","source_asin":"B08XNQKTPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1120208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XNQKTPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XNQKTPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
