window.products.push({"id":1120210,"name":"Projection Alarm Clock with USB Charger for Bedroom,Digital Alarm Clock for Heavy Sleepers Adults,7.4\" LED Display Radio Alarm Clock, Auto Dimmer Mode","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M1XljwjXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【180° Adjustable Projector & 4 Level Brightness】Our projection alarm clock with USB charger projects time on the wall in a soft red light,can provide clear projection from a distance of up to 5 meters.4 level adjustable screen brightness,you can set the brightest level for the day time and dimmed screen to your desired level to avoid bothering from the backlighting in the night time. You can easily control the time while lying in bed. No need to turn your head to check the time. 【Dual Alarms&Suitable for Heavy sleepers】Our loud Alarm Clock comes with 2 alarm methods: loud buzzer and Radio buzzer, actually make it easier to wake you up from deep sleep. The snooze button is located in a convenient central location, can easily turn off the alarm without opening your eyes to get 5 minutes of sleep time.The alarm will sound every 5 minutes until it is completely turned off,The alarm clock for bedroom is also the perfect choice for people with Heavy sleepers or hearing loss. 【Easy to Operate & Large display】Our Projection alarm clock with clearly marked button on the front and instructions , you will experience zero stress when setting the time or alarm.Simple Use Even for Seniors and Kids.It is a great gift alarm clock for kids family .Also our digital alarm clock comes with a 7.4 '' mirror LED display so that you can clearly see the time even if you are 30 feet away from your bedroom,Even without glasses. 【Radio Function】The FM radio alarm clock can automatically search, lock, and storage unlimited number stations within 76-108 MHz for your quickly and easily use. Adopting auto-off function allows you to set 5 to 90 minutes sleep timer and it will turn off automatically after the specified timer. Classical music before bed can help you relax and fall asleep quickly, while the morning news can help you focus on what's hot today, and all these can be achieved with this radio alarm clock. 【What You’ll Get】The package includes a alarm clock, A adapter, user manual,Worry-Free 24-month warranty and friendly customer service. If you have any problems on this Projection Alarm Clock, please feel free to contact us, we will offer you a best solution within 24 hours. Your safety and experience is our top priority, we got it all covered.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M1XljwjXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"befavcely","source_asin":"B09LYKH8RH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1120210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LYKH8RH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LYKH8RH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
