window.products.push({"id":1120512,"name":"Digital Milligram Mg Scale 50g x 0.001g, High Precisio Portable Jewelry Scale with LCD Backlit, Tare, Powder Scale, Micro Pocket Scale for Powder Medi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D+-0h7XsL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【50 x 0.001g High-Precision Digital Milligram Scale】 This electronic microgram scale equipped with a built-in smart high-precision sensor, can fast provide very accurate weighing data within 50g capacity and 0.001g resolution. Good for high accuracy weighing needs like jewelry, gem, diamonds, gold, powder, pills. ✔【Multifunction Mg Jewelry Scale Meet All Needs】With the \"Mode\" key, the reloading scale can easily convert units between oz/lb'oz/fl'oz/g/mL, thie one scale can help you measure different type of jewelry, power and medichine weighing needs. Easy pieces counting by PCS function. ✔【Portable Integrated Design Pocket Gram Scale】You can easily cove all the accessories into the scale with the lid and put the scale into the pocket, which is very convenient to store and carry. The built-in weight design allows you to calibrate the scale anytime, anywhere, improving the accuracy of weighing. ✔【Auto Off Micro Mini Scale with Tare Button】Tare button on the scales digital weight grams automatically subtracts the weight of the container, making it easy to get a accurate net weight of powder or jewelry. Included 20g calibration weight, makes it easy to recalibrate your micro scale without buying extra weights.The automatic shut-off feature that helps save power and extend its lifespan. ✔【Clear & Bright Large Blacklit LCD Screen】The powder scale with a backlit LCD screen which gives you to read the numbers clearly in the dark. Package includes: 1x milligram scale, 1x 20g calibration weight, 1×pallet, 1×scoop, 1×tweezers, 1 small spoon at the bottom of the scale(push it) and 2×AAA batteries. All of the mg scales are individually tested. If you have any questions, please look at the user manual or contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D+-0h7XsL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kolohoso","source_asin":"B09VY7KT6X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1120512","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VY7KT6X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VY7KT6X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
