window.products.push({"id":1120531,"name":"12pcs Reusable Silicone Stretch Lids, Flexible Container Lids Food Covers for All Shape of Containers, Microwave & Dishwasher Safe, Durable Food Saver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IOqWBPSWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"BeRicham SILICONE STRETCH LIDS – KITCHEN ACCESSORY FOR EVERY HOUSE !!! Product features: - These silicone lids are circular in shape but pliable enough to seal even odd-shaped containers. - Non-toxic, No BPA, A grade food silicone, dishwasher-safe & leak proof, air-tight seal to keep foods fresh. - You will find suitable size that fits all your mugs, pots, cups and bowls, 12 covers + 2 different color to fit the color of item. - Microwave and dishwasher-safe. heat-resistant to 450 f, reheating foods is never a problem for home use. - Save on expensive, disposable plastic wrap, and save money on food bills by storing scrumptious leftovers for another meal. Specifications: - Material: High Quality Food-grade Silicone - Heat resistance: -30 up to 230℃ - Colors: Blue & White - Size: - 2.6\" (Stretch to 3.5\") - 3.8\" (Stretch to 5\") - 4.5\" (Stretch to 6\") - 5.7\" (Stretch to 8\") - 6.5\" (Stretch to 9\") - 8.3\" (Stretch to 11\") Applications: - Can be used to cover cooked food, fruit, salads, sauces, as well as drinks like coffee, tea, juice and more. - Easily fit most bowls, pots, containers, mugs, cups, cans, jars, and you can even use them to cover your half-cut melon, watermelon and etc. How to use: 1. Place half of the lids over one edge of the container 2. Stretch the other half of the lid away from you, inching your way around the bowl 3. Stretch,then press the top of the lid while pulling the tabs to create a vacuum seal 4. Pull the sides to ensure a perfect fit What you get: - 12 × Silicone Stretch Lids (6 size / each size for 2 pack) Warming tips: - Lids are completely dry or they will not stay in place. - When you are using it in Microwave or Oven,do not completely seal container would be better, because the expanding heat and pressure from container, may result in damage or inju","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IOqWBPSWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHUANGYIJIA","source_asin":"B07MMZZH3L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1120531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MMZZH3L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MMZZH3L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
