window.products.push({"id":1120682,"name":"Rösle Open Kitchen Collection Digital Kitchen Scale and Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hGh9C6YIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Located in the Bavaria region of Germany, family- owned Rosle has been steadily creating the best tools and utensils in the world since 1888. Each Rosle product joins design and function in perfect harmony. 18/10 stainless steel is used in production providing a professional utensil that is not only aesthetically pleasing, but hygienic, neutral to flavors, odors and easy to clean. During the development phase - which lasts from 1 to 2 years on average - each product goes through a trial period where it is critically evaluated by cooking schools and professional chefs. During production, Rosle utensils go through an elaborate manufacturing processes and only leave the premises after passing strict quality control. Professional and home chefs alike sing the praise of this integrated collection, widely recognized as the best on the market. With German design and unrivaled material, Rosle continues to receive prestigious design prizes and a growing list of awards. Rosle's new Kitchen scale is a dual functioning device designed to display time and to measure up to 11lbs. The digital display for scale and clock features automatic mode switching: horizontal placement triggers weight measurement mode, upright or hanging placement displays time. Coated stainless steel top surface is coated to prevent fingerprints. Big format features easy read digital display, calibration option for deduction of container weight. Scale is designed to hang in Rosle's Open Kitchen rail system. Uses 3 AAA batteries. Brand Story By Rosle","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hGh9C6YIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rösle","source_asin":"B0028Y4GP6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1120682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0028Y4GP6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0028Y4GP6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1120683,"name":"Fluffydays Goose Down Comforter King Size, All Seasons Lightweight Down Alternative Comforter, White Duvet Insert with Corner Tabs, Machine Washable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gQgci3rwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐COMFORTABLE SLEEP✨Our goose down comforter is filled with premium sourced goose down and feathers (10% down and 90% feather) under rigorous quality control. The special design with higher thread counts can effectively prevent feather and down fillings from escaping. The cover is made of 100% organic cotton compliant to OCS and OEKO-TEX Standard 100. It is super comfortable and breathable which gives you an ultra-soft hand feel. ⭐SIZE WITH DIMENSIONS✨All season comforter king size, This 106 x 90 inch king size-sized duvet offers all-season and all year-round warmth and comfort with perfect thickness. It is perfectly weighted and fluffy enough to be snuggled warm. ⭐PROFESSIONAL AND VERSATILE DESIGN ✨ Professional design and versatility: The classic box stitching technology prevents the fillings from shifting, leaking out or clumping. This comforter can be easily put into a duvet cover and secured with loops and corner tabs. Also, it can be used as carried around blanket or stand-alone comforter. Furthermore, this comforter is a great choice for boutique hotel bedding. ⭐CARE INSTRUCTIONS✨ This comforter is machine washable and dryable. It is always well vacuum packed with zip bag before shipping or posting. After unpacking this down comforter, shake it well and leave it for hours until it puffs up (preferably in the sun). ⭐WARRANTY ✨ Our duvet insert is a perfect gift choice for any occasions such as Valentine’s Day, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Halloween, Thanksgiving Day, New Year’s Eve and Christmas etc. High product quality and well customer satisfaction are our priorities. We are aiming to provide the greatest customer experience as we can. If you have any problems with our products, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gQgci3rwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fluffydays","source_asin":"B09MQB7D4J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1120683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MQB7D4J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MQB7D4J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
