window.products.push({"id":1120750,"name":"WMF Touch with Blade Cover Chef's Knife, 32.5 x 10.3 x 2.8 cm, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PSfKBhv4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Alongside the cutting boards and stainless steel cutlery, the knives in the WMF Touch series are a bright and charming addition to any kitchen. Fresh, modern colours from the handle to the blade make chopping so much fun. The coated blade is made from special blade steel, making it extremely sharp and guaranteeing smooth, reliable cutting. It also ensures that nothing sticks to the blade. The plastic handle sits comfortably and securely in the hand and a matching blade guard allows you to store the knife safely in a drawer. The series consists of all-purpose and chef’s knives in 4 different colours. WMF also offers cutting boards and kitchen scissors in the colours to match. The chef’s knife is the jack of all trades amongst knives: its wide, strong blade glides smoothly through fish and meat, dicing even the hardest of vegetables. The chef’s knife also makes easy work of mincing herbs and chopping up nuts: simply place the tip of the knife on the cutting board and rock the blade up and down. And as if that weren’t enough, the broadside of the knife can be used for tenderising meat to make sure it is evenly flat, for example like a schnitzel. No wonder this highly versatile knife is regarded as a kitchen staple. WMF offers a variety of models with varying blade lengths (13, 15 and 20 centimetres) and characteristics for each knife collection. Your new favourite knife is sure to be amongst them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PSfKBhv4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WMF","source_asin":"B09J21GVSJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1120750","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J21GVSJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J21GVSJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
